{
  "name": "Create self-improving TikTok carousels with Gemini, fal.ai, OpenAI and Sheets",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "4da2ba44-04b4-42c6-9e28-eeb5820a567f",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -1248,
        -64
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 896,
        "content": "## Auto-create self-improving TikTok carousels with Gemini, fal.ai & Upload-Post\n\n### How it works\n\n1. Runs daily (or manually) and loads product info and Upload-Post credentials from Set Config.\n2. Refreshes TikTok analytics of previous posts in the Google Sheets Performance Log via the Upload-Post API.\n3. Compiles post and profile analytics with the Agent Skill memory into a context for Gemini.\n4. Gemini plans a new 4-slide carousel; fal.ai renders the slides; OpenAI writes the caption.\n5. Upload-Post publishes the carousel to TikTok and logs the post to the sheet.\n6. OpenAI rewrites the Agent Skill with what it learned, so each run improves the next.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- [ ] Copy the Google Sheet template (Performance Log + Agent Skill tabs) and paste its ID in Set Config\n- [ ] Add Google Sheets OAuth2 credentials to the four Sheets nodes\n- [ ] Add Google Gemini and OpenAI credentials\n- [ ] Add a fal.ai HTTP Header Auth credential (Authorization: Key <FAL_KEY>)\n- [ ] Create an Upload-Post account at https://www.upload-post.com, connect TikTok to a profile and paste user + API key in Set Config\n\n### Customization\n\nEdit product fields and the Strategy Agent prompt for your niche, change the fal.ai model or slide count, or add more platforms in the Upload to TikTok node."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "6d77fa31-8b35-448a-8de5-f3652a81d3be",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -688,
        128
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 384,
        "height": 512,
        "content": "## Trigger and configuration\n\nRuns daily or on demand. Set Config holds your product name/description and your Upload-Post username and API key, so every later step reads them from one place."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "afeb075f-58a5-45e3-a85f-32557fff6689",
      "name": "Sticky Note2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -256,
        176
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 1344,
        "height": 304,
        "content": "## Refresh analytics of past posts\n\nReads the Performance Log sheet, skips rows that already have fresh stats, fetches views/likes/comments/shares for each TikTok post from the Upload-Post analytics API and writes the engagement rate back to the sheet."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "7cdab8a2-1d7c-44da-9224-db3d1c6a51ab",
      "name": "Sticky Note3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1120,
        144
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 688,
        "height": 320,
        "content": "## Build the learning context\n\nPulls profile-level TikTok analytics, reads the current Agent Skill memory and the refreshed log, and compiles everything into one context summary the agent can reason about."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "d386466b-8f29-49ce-83ec-684de91ffa71",
      "name": "Sticky Note4",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1840,
        128
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 544,
        "height": 576,
        "content": "## Strategy agent plans the carousel\n\nGemini uses the Think tool to analyse what worked, then returns a structured plan: hook/title, four slide image prompts, hashtags and an engagement question. Set Vars flattens the plan for the next steps."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "da25f7e5-306a-445b-befc-1f8c9223c420",
      "name": "Sticky Note5",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        2416,
        -64
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 800,
        "height": 784,
        "content": "## Render the four slides\n\nEach prompt is sent in parallel to fal.ai (nano-banana-2) to generate a 9:16 image; the four URLs are merged and aggregated into one item."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "df7f44cf-3342-4b67-a228-d45c37859047",
      "name": "Sticky Note6",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        3248,
        96
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 688,
        "height": 320,
        "content": "## Caption, publish and log\n\nOpenAI writes a short TikTok caption, Upload-Post publishes the photo carousel to TikTok and the new post is appended to the Performance Log so it gets analytics on the next run."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "820b5060-b0dd-4d0a-bd95-10cfd4845fae",
